Description: Presents json and Python data in a list-like view in Sphinx (Python 3)
 Adds an interactive data viewer for data objects to Sphinx.
 .
 Use it to document:
 .
   * JSON data
   * JSON files
   * Python objects
 .
 This package installs the library for Python 3.

